<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-11-17T15:43:31+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>Secondary academic repository, BibTeX publication archive, and technical research blog of Dr. Shahadat Hussain. For the official main website, visit shahadathussain.com. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-15T20:15:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-15T20:15:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[I just mapped the citation network of my latest paper https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s40964-026-01791-9 in Progress in Additive Manufacturing using @litmaps.com, and it’s a brilliant way to visualize research lineage.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-14T14:04:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-14T14:04:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Been thinking about how hard it is to get field-normalized citation metrics (like FWCI) without Scopus or institutional subscriptions. Just found out you can pull live, open-source FWCI breakdowns directly from ORCID and OpenAlex—no paywall or account needed. @frontierresearch.co]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-09T21:30:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-09T21:30:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Design freedom is changing the rules of mechanical behavior. It lets engineers tailor internal geometries like TPMS lattices to tune stiffness, weight, and energy absorption on demand. 👤 https://tinyurl.com/bibsys-shahadat #MaterialsScience #Metamaterials #3DPrinting]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-07T04:28:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-07T04:28:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Spent a day at ADIPEC 2026 at ADNEC Abu Dhabi! 🇦🇪⚡️ Great conversations on the future of energy, advanced materials, asset integrity, and the role of AI & decarbonization across the sector. Always inspiring to connect with fellow researchers and industry leaders. #AcademicSky #MaterialsScience #RnD]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-04T15:57:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-04T15:57:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[https://x.com/ADIPECOfficial/status/2118004689858179242?a=fbjVhLokKXfBY-PQUls&s=20]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-11-02T03:02:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-02T03:02:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Happy to have my name registered aboard NASA's Dragonfly mission to Saturn's moon, Titan! Dragonfly will fly across Titan to seek clues to life's origin. https://my.nasa.gov/specialevents/s/send-your-name-with-dragonfly 🛸 Titan bound in 2028! @NASASolarSystem #Dragonfly #SendYourName #JourneyToTitan #PlanetaryScience #Spacenerds]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-10-26T22:59:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-26T22:59:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[🚀 Exciting advancement in metal additive manufacturing! The University of Turku has upgraded its metal 3D printer to deposit three different metal powders in a single layer. This opens up brand-new possibilities for multi-material components in fusion energy and aerospace. 🌌🔬]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-10-26T11:08:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-26T11:08:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[@bot.astronomy.blue signup]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-10-25T18:58:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-25T18:58:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Engineering Applications of Fiber-Reinforced TPMS Lattices: From Theory to Practice https://drshahadathussain.substack.com/p/engineering-applications-of-fiber?r=5k6c87&utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&utm_medium=web #MaterialsScience #AdditiveManufacturing #Aerospace #Automotive #Submarines #3DPrinting #Metamaterials #AcademicSky]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)</title><link href="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Shahadat Hussain ⚙️ (@shahadathussain.com)"/><published>2026-10-23T20:10:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-23T20:10:00+00:00</updated><id>https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain--shahadathussaincom</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://academic.shahadathussain.com/blog/2026/shahadat-hussain-shahadathussaincom/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="external-posts"/><category term="bluesky"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Exploring process–structure–property relationships in 3D-printed TPMS metamaterials and Interpenetrating Phase Composites at NYUAD. Always open to interdisciplinary research, joint grant applications, and industrial R&D testing.]]></summary></entry></feed>